<b>But I don't have
any money for cake.</b>

00:58.550 --> 01:02.180
<b>I'm baking a cake nyo.
It's Christmas nyo.</b>

01:02.290 --> 01:03.950
<b>Put on some whipped cream nyo.</b>

01:06.030 --> 01:09.060
<b>I made it nyo!
It's a yummy looking cake nyo.</b>

01:09.170 --> 01:11.960
