when it explodes nyo.</b>

01:14.070 --> 01:17.010
<b>I'm going to give this to Usada nyo.</b>

01:17.340 --> 01:19.900
<b>Then Usada is going to explode nyo.</b>

01:21.080 --> 01:22.480
<b>Jingle bells!</b>

01:22.580 --> 01:24.170
<b>Jingle bells...</b>

01:24.280 --> 01:27.840
<b>Puchiko-chan, I can see
your happy smile in my mind.</b>

01:27.950 --> 01:31.480
<b>Rabi-en-Rose.
Oh, this is embarrassing.</b>

01:32.290 --> 01:34.690
<b>We'll eat this together nyo!</b>

01:34.790 --> 01:39.590
<b>Since it's my day to clean up,
I can't eat this nyo.</b>

01:39.700 --> 01:41.490
<b>You should have it, Usada, nyo.</b>

01:42.270 --> 01:43.230
<b>For me?</b>

01:43.330 --> 01:44.660
<b>Cake ge-</b>

01:45.270 --> 01:48.730
