Gema!</b>

01:51.870 --> 01:55.370
<b>C'mon, Usada, take this home
and eat it quickly nyo.</b>

01:56.080 --> 01:57.440
<b>Oh, I feel bad.</b>

01:57.550 --> 02:00.680
<b>But since you're giving it to me,
I guess I'll take it. Thanks, Dejiko!</b>

02:00.780 --> 02:02.650
<b>Oh, no problem nyo.</b>

02:02.750 --> 02:05.410
<b>Jingle bells,jingle bells...</b>

02:08.890 --> 02:09.920
<b>Gema?</b>

02:11.990 --> 02:13.860
<b>My chest hurts nyo.</b>

02:14.630 --> 02:15.930
<b>What's wrong with me nyo?</b>

02:16.030 --> 02:18.430
<b>Thanks, Dejiko!</b>

02:19.840 --> 02:22.930
<b>Is this what people call
a conscience, nyo?</b>

02:30.180 --> 02:34.780
<b>I made this cake
for Usada and me nyo!</b>

02:36.050 --> 02:37.450
<b>Ho ho ho.
Jingle bells...</b>

02:37.550 --> 02:39.950
<b>Dejiko-chan,
let's have a Christmas party nyon.</b>

02:40.060 --> 02:43.080
<b>We'll help you
clean up the store nyon.</b>

02:43.190 --> 02:46.820
<b>This is a gift to you from me.
Please take it. And for you guys, too.</b>

02:46.930 --> 02:49.330
<b>Hey, where's Rabi-en-Rose?</b>

02:50.900 --> 02:55.340
